===Alternative forms===
Colloquial forms are
* {{l|de|fuffzehn}} {{IPAchar|[ˈfʊft͡seːn]|lang=de}} in northern and central Germany;
* {{l|de|fuchzehn}} {{IPAchar|[ˈfʊxt͡seːn]|lang=de}} in southern Germany and Austria.

These forms are frequent in pronunciation, but rare in writing, the more so as numerals above 12 are usually not written out in German texts.

